      <h1 id="virt-exposing-downward-metrics" class="group scroll-mt-20">Exposing downward metrics for virtual machines<a href="#virt-exposing-downward-metrics" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h1>
