      <h2 id="virt-viewing-downward-metrics-tool_virt-exposing-downward-metrics" class="group scroll-mt-20">Viewing downward metrics by using the vm-dump-metrics tool<a href="#virt-viewing-downward-metrics-tool_virt-exposing-downward-metrics" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h2>
